        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "挺 + gradable predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "挺 before an adjective gives a conversational positive or noticeable evaluation, often with final 的. It does not mean standing upright here.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书挺好的。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū tǐng hǎo de 。",
                "meaning": "This book is pretty good.",
                "audio": "60e10b349c268b0933288ea5f5031def6bb3de096838a4cc2972489a1b75ae43"
              },
              {
                "text": "他挺忙的。",
                "pinyin": "tā tǐng máng de 。",
                "meaning": "He is quite busy.",
